1
00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:04,347
Somewhere along the way, games forgot how to be quiet.

2
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:08,564
Open your phone tonight, and everything begs for your eyes.

3
00:00:08,664 --> 00:00:11,583
Flashing numbers, fake timers, endless noise.

4
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:16,542
All of it built to keep your thumb moving, while your mind feels nothing at all.

5
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,172
Whatever happened to getting lost in the dark?

6
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:24,221
To standing small beneath an ancient sky,

7
00:00:24,321 --> 00:00:28,012
where nothing holds your hand, and every shadow feels older than you.

8
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:33,355
Out of that silence, we began shaping a free dark-fantasy world,

9
00:00:33,435 --> 00:00:36,355
called Rotten Crown.

10
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:42,975
Rain over pale fields. Cold iron, and silent watchers where the fires went out.

11
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,410
Still unfinished. Still taking form in the shadows.
